## Where build artifacts go

The build's scratch tree is a contract. These are its paths, relative to the repository root:

```
@!layout-paths!@
```

A segment in angle brackets is filled in by the caller and reaches you in your assignment. Every path you write to, and every path you put into a brief you compose, comes from an assignment.

The tree is scratch, not knowledge-base content: writing under it is not the KB authorship a worker's own definition may forbid.
